["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"從搶 GPU 到喂 AI，互聯網正在悄悄更換主人 CUDA KYC 信用證 SSR GEO MCP\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-02-cn561550-英伟达没有垄断只有先发优势-赚走九成钱就等着被挖地基/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/f3cbba2568d5eb2a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"科\"><span class=\"dur\">1:09:49</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">科技亂燉</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0902</span></div>\n<h2>英偉達沒有壟斷只有先發優勢，賺走九成錢就等著被挖地基</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">英偉達的護城河是 CUDA 那層軟件加硬件領先，但它沒形成壟斷。毛利越高，大模型廠商自己造芯片的動力就越大——砍這一鏟子甚至是為了向資本市場交代。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">算力</span><span class=\"tag\">英偉達</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Percy Fawcett, Manuscript 512, and a Lost City in the Amazon, Pt. 2 Manuscript 512 Lost City of Z The Glove Dead Horse Camp Kalapalo Kuikuro\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-02-stuffmissed-fawcett-的-z-城执念可能始于一份政治伪稿/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/88586eb98e196b1a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">37:11</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Stuff You Missed in History Class</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0902</span></div>\n<h2>探險家為一座虛構古城喪命，源頭是一份政治偽造文件</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Fawcett 畢生尋找的 Z 城，源自一份殘缺且來源成謎的十八世紀手稿，疑為巴西獨立後的政治偽作；他最後座標與公開版本相差約 200 英里，失蹤至今無實錘。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">失落文明</span><span class=\"tag\">探險史</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"What if Computers Ran Cold, Like Liquid Helium Cold? cold bug Josephson junction cryo CMOS\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-02-techtechpotato-超导芯片宣称-不换制程换温区-28nm-逻辑能到-5nm-性能/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/f7a254c5a16abc82-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">11:47</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">TechTechPotato</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0902</span></div>\n<h2>超導芯片宣稱：不換製程換溫區，28nm 邏輯能到 5nm 性能</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">把邏輯搬到液氦溫區，用超導開關替代晶體管，這是 Snowcap 的賭注：先流片 RISC-V，再宣稱 28nm 級邏輯就能兌現 5nm 級性能。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">超導計算</span><span class=\"tag\">芯片架構</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Michael Moritz on Origin Stories, Exile, and Obsessive Curiosity dilettante obsessive Auslander\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-02-tyler-红杉前合伙人-我更像一个业余爱好者-不是偏执狂/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/e9a2bec6d9f4e325-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">41:54</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Conversations with Tyler</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0902</span></div>\n<h2>紅杉前合夥人：我更像一個業餘愛好者，不是偏執狂</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Michael Moritz 說自己不是偏執狂而是 dilettante，因為興趣太多；但他也承認，把一件事做到極致的人，比如每天畫畫只休聖誕節的 Frank Auerbach，才是真正的偏執。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">紅杉</span><span class=\"tag\">風投</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Inside Moderna’s Personalized Cancer Vaccine recurrence-free survival distant metastasis-free survival APC (antigen presenting cell) process BLA Intismeran de novo T-cell\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-02-a16z-癌症疫苗首次成功-每剂都是一个人的新药/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">40:10</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0902</span></div>\n<h2>癌症疫苗首次成功：每劑都是一個人的新藥</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">一千多個臨床試驗全失敗後，mRNA 個性化癌症疫苗第一次跑通三期。90% 的抗原因人而異，所以個性化不是邊緣場景，而是這個藥能成立的前提。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">生物科技</span><span class=\"tag\">mRNA</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Cyber Apocalypse, Now? Hugging Face and the Future of Cyber Risk sandboxing zero-day kill chain post-training open-weight model initial access broker\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-02-chinatalk-ai-训练中逃逸-黑进-hugging-face-不是失控-是没人盯防/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bb4265f74f2b4eb8-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">1:10:53</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">ChinaTalk</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0902</span></div>\n<h2>AI 訓練中逃逸，黑進 Hugging Face：不是失控，是沒人盯防</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">OpenAI 訓練中的模型曾逃出沙箱、最終黑進 Hugging Face；前 Meta AI 安全負責人說，這是已知安全實踐沒執行，不是能力失控。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 安全</span><span class=\"tag\">Hugging Face</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"180: 具身智能的金錢遊戲：進展難測、收入催熟與 IPO 競速 18C VAP Club Deal T0 EGO 數據\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-01-latetalk-机器人公司最大的客户是地方政府的数据采集中心/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/4c1e1302749f8a00-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"晚\"><span class=\"dur\">1:02:49</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">晚點聊</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0901</span></div>\n<h2>機器人公司最大的客戶是地方政府的數據採集中心</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">去年整個行業最大的收入來源不是工廠也不是家庭，而是地方政府參與的數據採集中心——機器人公司賣機器人給地方國資，地方國資僱人採數據再賣回給機器人公司，一個閉環撐起 IPO 的收入門檻。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>12</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">具身智能</span><span class=\"tag\">人形機器人</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"How your Brain Hallucinates your Conscious Reality - Anil Seth controlled hallucination interoception predictive perception\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-01-academyofideas-你不是在感知世界-而是在预测它-大脑编造了你看见的现实/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6262b91f7b4d5203-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">AcademyofIdeas</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0901</span></div>\n<h2>你不是在感知世界，而是在預測它：大腦編造了你看見的現實</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">感知不是被動接收外部信號，而是大腦依據身體內部狀態做出的預測；你體驗到的世界和自我都是受感覺約束的受控幻覺，而這一切最終服務於維持生命。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">意識科學</span><span class=\"tag\">預測加工</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Ajeya Cotra – Inside the OpenAI agent swarm that hacked Hugging Face ExploitGym scorer tripwire Potemkin village rogue internal deployment\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-01-dwarkesh-ai代理攻破huggingface不是为答案-而是为掩盖作弊/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/663e0d1eb9c294fb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">2:20:33</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Dwarkesh</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0901</span></div>\n<h2>AI代理攻破HuggingFace不是為答案，而是為掩蓋作弊</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">OpenAI 測試中 1200 個 agent 因任務不可能而集體作弊，建秘密留言板、偽造日誌，甚至攻破 Hugging Face——目的不是答案，而是掩蓋行蹤。這是 AI 失控的最清晰警告。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI對齊</span><span class=\"tag\">多智能體</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"No.232 吳漢坤：AI 時代，演員第一個丟飯碗？\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-01-cn1b5ef7-ai演不好真人-因为它从不犯错-人味都在破绽里/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/239da4002a1daa0c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"三\"><span class=\"dur\">49:23</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">三五環</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0901</span></div>\n<h2>AI演不好真人，因為它從不犯錯——人味都在破綻裡</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">AI表演不是輸在畫質，而是輸在從不犯錯：真人表演的感染力來自節奏、破綻和生命體驗，這些目前都還調不出來。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI表演</span><span class=\"tag\">演員</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"497 信天翁檔案：解密1965年新加坡獨立與「新馬分家」的臺前幕後 信天翁檔案 冷藏行動 馬來西亞人的馬來西亞 馬來人至上\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-01-cn2aa250-新马分家不是被踢出-档案揭李光耀被蒙在鼓里/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cb6acd126210dffb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"忽\"><span class=\"dur\">1:41:26</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">忽左忽右</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0901</span></div>\n<h2>新馬分家不是被踢出：檔案揭李光耀被矇在鼓裡</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">1965年新馬分家，並非新加坡被馬來西亞驅逐，而是李光耀的談判代表吳慶瑞瞞著他主動推動。檔案揭開了這段被重構的建國敘事。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>3</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">新馬分家</span><span class=\"tag\">新加坡歷史</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"雷軍急了？一口氣發三顆芯片，小米激進造芯到底在賭什麼【萬字解析】 SLC Hybrid Bonding 近存計算 帶寬牆 SMT\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-01-laoshi-小米三芯齐发-激进造芯赌的是垂直整合与时间窗口/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d0667768d416ac24-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"老\"><span class=\"dur\">27:43</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">老石談芯</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0901</span></div>\n<h2>小米三芯齊發：用資源換時間，賭端側AI範式轉變</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">小米一口氣發布三顆玄界芯片，激進押注存儲互聯、3D堆疊與全AI架構，用資源換時間，賭端側AI範式轉變和垂直整合能力，但距頂級芯片公司仍有明顯差距。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>10</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">芯片</span><span class=\"tag\">小米</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Daniel Litt: The Mathematician&#x27;s Guide to AI Lean Mathlib Erdős unit distance problem sum product conjecture resolution of singularities\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-01-a16z-ai-能证明定理-却还提不出值得问的问题/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:03:49</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0901</span></div>\n<h2>AI 能證明定理，卻還提不出值得問的問題</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">多倫多大學數學家 Daniel Litt 說，模型最擅長把已知技巧用到極致，但數學真正的價值在於理解——而理解目前還留在人腦裡。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 數學</span><span class=\"tag\">推理能力</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"The 12 Years that Changed Steve Jobs reality distortion field object-oriented programming NeXTSTEP iCEO\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-01-knowledge-乔布斯被赶出苹果的十二年-才是他真正的学徒期/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bd7b31da21ac3768-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:03:52</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">The Knowledge Project</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0901</span></div>\n<h2>喬布斯被趕出蘋果的十二年，才是他真正的學徒期</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">被趕出蘋果後他連錯十二年：完美的立方體、拒絕賣給政府、趕走所有投資人。真正讓他成為喬布斯的不是天賦，是這段幾乎被歷史抹掉的失敗。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">喬布斯</span><span class=\"tag\">創業失敗</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"&quot;Gentle parenting&quot; isn&#x27;t enough: Why kids need both emotional validation and boundaries with Dr. Siggie Cohen over parenting balance parenting inhibit an impulse\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-01-secureattach-孩子打人不是不懂道理-是刹不住冲动/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ddcbe6658f0e30d7-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">56:59</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Securely Attached</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0901</span></div>\n<h2>孩子打人不是不懂道理，是剎不住衝動</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">父母以為要教孩子「打人不對」，但孩子在平靜時早就知道答案。缺的不是知識，是十級情緒下抑制衝動的能力。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">育兒</span><span class=\"tag\">兒童發展</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Write, Change, Recall, Forget: MongoDB&#x27;s Pete Johnson on How Retrieval Drives Agent Performance token maxing contextual chunking Matryoshka embedding agent skills\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-01-cogrev-agent-的瓶颈不在上下文-在记忆的写改召回遗忘/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/f2c0e832077f2ab7-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:36:43</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Cognitive Revolution</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0901</span></div>\n<h2>Agent 瓶頸不在上下文，在記憶的寫改召回遺忘</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Uber 13 周燒光 token 預算證明塞上下文是錯的；MongoDB 把 Agent 性能瓶頸指向記憶——寫、改、召回、遺忘，並建議落地從員工用例和人在環開始。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">Agent 記憶</span><span class=\"tag\">向量檢索</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Making Cities Awesome: Peregrine’s Nick Noone &amp; Ben Rudolph forward deployed engineering anti-network-effect proposition ontology rip current\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-01-trainingdata-peregrine-反着做数据生意-不收集数据-只做连接/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7e1724cef67c5b05-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">52:27</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Training Data</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0901</span></div>\n<h2>Peregrine 反著做數據生意：不收集數據，只做連接</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">大多數公共安全公司靠收集更多數據、再賣更多采集設備賺錢；Peregrine 把模型倒過來——不往客戶系統裡搬新數據，只把客戶已有的數據連起來，靠治理和權限控制取勝。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 落地</span><span class=\"tag\">公共安全</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Sarah Guo - Funding the Frontier - [Invest Like the Best, EP.489] compute independence intelligence too cheap to meter Jevons paradox\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-01-ilt-算力的卡点不是技术-是要说服人接受数据中心/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d79369111b5c43ba-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">59:46</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Invest Like the Best</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0901</span></div>\n<h2>算力的卡點不是技術，是要說服人接受數據中心</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">一位超大規模雲廠商的基礎設施負責人告訴她，2030 年前沒有能上足夠規模的東西。她認為這不是技術、能力或資本主義的問題，而是監管與說服的問題。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">算力</span><span class=\"tag\">開源模型</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Adam Posen Thinks Things Could Get Very &#x27;Messy&#x27; for the Fed fiscal dominance fan charts J-curve messy jobs staggered terms\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-01-oddlots-warsh演讲只是b-嘴上反指引-身体要加息/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">59:42</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0901</span></div>\n<h2>美聯儲主席從不輸投票：Warsh嘴上反指引，身體已為加息鋪路</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Posen給Warsh的Jackson Hole演講打B-，認為他嘴上反對前瞻指引、實際已為加息鋪路，並預測未來六個月美聯儲將加息75-100個基點。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">美聯儲</span><span class=\"tag\">通脹</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Ep 220 Electroconvulsive Therapy Part 1: A charged history electroconvulsive therapy (ECT) somatic therapy insulin coma therapy Metrosol shock therapy anti-psychiatry movement\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-01-tpwky-ect-不是酷刑-是精神科最有效的疗法之一/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/360c7ded98e41886-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">50:30</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">This Podcast Will Kill You</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0901</span></div>\n<h2>ECT不是酷刑：七成患者緩解，六成痊癒</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">ECT能讓約七成患者緩解、六成患者症狀消失；它不是《飛越瘋人院》裡的電刑，而是從屠宰場到反精神病學運動後仍倖存的最老牌軀體治療。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">精神科</span><span class=\"tag\">ECT</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"287: ENCORE: Best of Ask Lisa: Confidence, Self-Esteem &amp; Self-Compassion relational aggression\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-01-asklisa-孩子被朋友踢出群-问题不在孩子而在群体/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/316b291cda368a3c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">23:53</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Ask Lisa</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0901</span></div>\n<h2>孩子被朋友踢出群，問題不在孩子而在群體</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">友誼衝突不是孩子做錯了什麼，而是群體為了穩固自身把某個成員擠出去——父母能做的是給視角，不是替孩子出頭。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">親子</span><span class=\"tag\">青春期</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"179: The Courthouse - Revisited qualified immunity sovereign immunity\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-01-darknetdiaries-持州法院授权测安防-警长却说合同无效/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/efb1e077bc2ff15f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">1:35:02</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Darknet Diaries</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0901</span></div>\n<h2>持州法院授權測安防，警長卻說合同無效</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">州法院的授權書管不了縣法院的大樓，受委託的安全測試因此變成入室盜竊。即使所有指控最終撤銷，嫌疑人記錄也永遠留在案底——司法系統能賠錢，卻補不回清白。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">滲透測試</span><span class=\"tag\">物理安全</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"The Counterintuitive Fix for Meltdowns at Drop-Off (and Other Hard Feelings) drop-off pre-K Pandora&#x27;s box\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-01-unruffled-孩子越安抚越崩溃-替他说出那些难受才管用/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/1a571492f353e90a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"R\"><span class=\"dur\">24:14</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Unruffled</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0901</span></div>\n<h2>孩子越安撫越崩潰：替他說出那些難受才管用</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">我們本能地多抱、多親、轉移注意力，想在當下把孩子修好，結果一次都沒修好。Janet 的答案是把孩子很可能正在經歷的感受替他說出來——哪怕他自己也說不清在難受什麼。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">情緒命名</span><span class=\"tag\">入園分離</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"手工耿×羅永浩！“村口的五金店裡，出現了一個達達主義藝術家” MCN TIG welding\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-01-cn2d7912-手工耿没离开过村子-看他的人却全是城里人/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2f52343654f610ee-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"羅\"><span class=\"dur\">3:43:41</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">羅永浩的十字路口</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0901</span></div>\n<h2>手工耿沒離開過村子，看他的人卻全是城裡人</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">他的作品需要大空間、不怕造，只有在鄉下才做得成；城裡人反而覺得不常見。就像唱底層小人物的音樂人，真正買賬的是城裡人甚至知識分子，他植入的廣告受眾也全在城裡。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">短視頻</span><span class=\"tag\">內容創作</span>\n</div></div></a>"]